{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1107874667"}, "name":{"label":"MissRoxieC"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-31T19:34:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.77.0"}, "id":{"label":"10887110185"}, "title":{"label":"Awesome app"}, "content":{"label":"I was looking for a water tracker that had an Apple Watch app and there are just two available. The other one was very expensive (for me at least) and that’s how I started using WaterLlama and I’m happy I did. \n\nI like that you can add all sorts of drinks (I was curious how much tea I drink a day, for example). You have a bunch of beverages to choose from and if they don’t have it you can create it. I like that it tells you how much hydration you get from every drink (didn’t know it’s a different level depending on the drink - thank you, WaterLlama). I like the challenges (they also have cute names) - didn’t think I would get into challenges on a water intake app. Haha \n\nThe team was also nice and answered all my questions in timely matter. So big thumbs up for WaterLlama. Hmm… why did they choose a Llama? Well, if you’re not into llamas, you can choose other characters in the app (I wished they would have an old fashioned bottle or glass).", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"7"}}, 
